<<set $name1 to "Protagonist">>
{$name1}: Ugh ... it's so dark ...
{$name1}: Hey, (friend), are you okay?
...
{$name1}: Hello...?
// the screen comes up. Only a small area around the protagonist is illuminated. They turn left and right. But her companion is nowhere to be seen.
{$name1}: Shit! Where'd she go? She went in with me, right?
{$name1}: ... I guess there's no way now but in. Here's to hoping she's okay.
