// You step through an open sliding door, like the ones found in schools. In front of you, there's a sign. (This is all an automated sequence)
:The sign in front of you reads in large letters:
Warning - DO NOT BREATHE IN THE HALLWAYS.
Rulebreakers will be punished.

Looks like you better hold your breath.

<<add_game_scene "test">>

Hold F to hold your breath.

<<remove_game_scene "test">>

