title: Rules
position: 34,-36
---
{$name3}: One person has to go in the middle with their eyes closed. That person is "Oni".
{$name3}: The other players walk around that person in a circle and chant:
{$name3}: "Kagome, Kagome"
{$name3}: "Kago no naka tori ha"
{$name3}: "Itsu itsu de yaru"
{$name3}: "Yo ake no banni"
{$name3}: "Tsuruto kame ga subetta"
{$name3}: "Ushiro no shoumen dare"
{$name3}: When the chant is finished, everybody has to stop walking and "Oni" has to guess who's standing behind them.
